urface reflections. An adult woman in her late twenties sits sideways on a low angular black pedestal, her upright torso near the upper-right third. Her exceptionally long legs extend diagonally toward the lower-left foreground, crossed neatly at the ankles and ending in sharp black pumps. Show her complete figure at a large scale, preserving elegant anatomy and a clear continuous silhouette. She wears a fitted black satin dress with one thigh-high slit, long glossy gloves and a small dark silver earring. Her loose black hair falls behind one shoulder. She meets the viewer with an unwavering gaze and a restrained, knowing smile; saturated crimson lipstick gives her face its most concentrated color accent. One gloved hand hooks loosely over the pedestal’s edge, its poised fingers suggesting controlled menace.\n\nBuild the background from two unequal fields of deep scarlet and blue-black. The pedestal’s sloping edge continues the direction of her legs, while her elongated cast shadow stretches upward across the scarlet field into a sharply tapered shape. Keep a clear interval around her face and an open dark region beside the extended legs.\n\nHard ivory light from the upper left models her cheekbone, lips, collarbone and the long turning planes of her legs. Scarlet reflected light warms the shadowed skin, glove edges and underside of the satin folds; cooler blue reflections separate black hair from black fabric. Preserve deep recesses beneath the seated figure. Distinguish the dress’s broad curved highlights from the gloves’ narrow mirrored streaks, the pedestal’s restrained lacquer reflections and the skin’s delicate graded color. Resolve precise lip contours, small moist highlights, individual eyelashes, layered hair filaments, dress seams and the pressure folds where satin meets the pedestal. Let the richest detail gather around her face and poised hand, with the long leg contours carrying the composition toward the foreground. Maintain an elegant, dangerous, unlettered graphic composition."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "正文提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [450, 330], "pos": [614, 2], "id": 1004, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2, "widgets_values_named": {"value": "An elaborate Japanese anime fashion-art poster with razor-fine tapered ink contours, sculpted luminous cel shading and richly differentiated surface reflections. An adult woman in her late twenties sits sideways on a low angular black pedestal, her upright torso near the upper-right third. Her exceptionally long legs extend diagonally toward the lower-left foreground, crossed neatly at the ankles and ending in sharp black pumps. Show her complete figure at a large scale, preserving elegant anatomy and a clear continuous silhouette. She wears a fitted black satin dress with one thigh-high slit, long glossy gloves and a small dark silver earring. Her loose black hair falls behind one shoulder. She meets the viewer with an unwavering gaze and a restrained, knowing smile; saturated crimson lipstick gives her face its most concentrated color accent. One gloved hand hooks loosely over the pedestal’s edge, its poised fingers suggesting controlled menace.\n\nBuild the background from two unequal fields of deep scarlet and blue-black. The pedestal’s sloping edge continues the direction of her legs, while her elongated cast shadow stretches upward across the scarlet field into a sharply tapered shape. Keep a clear interval around her face and an open dark region beside the extended legs.\n\nHard ivory light from the upper left models her cheekbone, lips, collarbone and the long turning planes of her legs. Scarlet reflected light warms the shadowed skin, glove edges and underside of the sati